    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/7cc7b0a6e44127d086bd2c3dd4f7d254.svg) ⟨28⟩\nArchidexter⟨28⟩\n/\nadlindel-assets⟨29⟩\nlike 2\nLicense:\ncpml\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨30⟩ Community ⟨31⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨32⟩. You can try uploading⟨33⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨34⟩ the data files location manually.\n  * Files⟨35⟩\n  * License⟨36⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨37⟩ AD.Lindel assets \nDownload mirror for AD.Lindel⟨38⟩ — a free launcher that sets up SkyrimNet⟨39⟩ (AI-driven NPC dialogue) on Skyrim builds. The launcher downloads these archives on demand; they are of little use on their own.\n##   ⟨35⟩ Files   \n| File  | What it is  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| `SkyrimNet_XTTS.7z`  | Local XTTS voice server for SkyrimNet (`skyrimnet-xtts.exe` + models, incl. Russian voices). Based on langfod/skyrimnet-tts⟨40⟩; contains Coqui XTTS-v2⟨41⟩ weights.  |  \n| `SkyrimNetPiperModels.zip`  | Russian voices for SkyrimNet's built-in Piper⟨42⟩ TTS, packaged as a Mod Organizer 2 mod. Renamed stock rhasspy/piper-voices⟨43⟩ ru_RU models: `FemaleEvenToned` = **irina** (voice data from RHVoice⟨44⟩), `MaleCommoner` = **ruslan** (RUSLAN corpus⟨45⟩, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). Includes espeak-ng⟨46⟩ phoneme data (GPL-3.0).  |  \n##   ⟨36⟩ License \n**Non-commercial use and redistribution only.**\n  * XTTS-v2 model weights — Coqui Public Model License 1.0.0⟨47⟩ (non-commercial)\n  * **ruslan** voice — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (RUSLAN corpus)\n  * **irina** voice — RHVoice voice data: free personal use and redistribution by individuals; no commercial/organizational use\n  * espeak-ng data — GPL-3.0\n  * piper — MIT\n\n\nAll credit for the models and tools goes to their authors. This repository only mirrors the archives so the launcher has a download source without daily quotas.\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    580\nTotal file size: 9.54 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨48⟩ Privacy⟨49⟩ About⟨50⟩ Careers⟨51⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
